{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: Strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated. [2]\n- **Orbitly**: Works as a lightweight request queue for small teams. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Focused on selling, with only basic ticket handling. [4]\n\nIn short, if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Orbitly keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f7-7695-86e6-e063f61754a6","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:04.250Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["unified customer record small business","sales and support in one tool"],"latency_ms":5120,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[145,155],[444,454]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[244,251],[466,473]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[317,330]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"perplexity/sonar","prom